# The first sitting earns a public status and quits; the second opens that
# conversation again, so the note on screen is the one the store gave back
# rather than the one the frame that drew it still remembers.
# The pause between them is what lets the exit banner be captured: the
# second sitting takes the screen the moment it starts, and on an idle host
# that is sooner than the driver's next look at the pane.
$SHHH_BIN code; sleep 2; $SHHH_BIN code --continue
